    <system:String x:Key="Screen.Instructions">How to check: press “Start test” — the selected monitor switches to fullscreen solid colors (white → red → green → blue → black, cycling).
Press any key or left-click = next color; press Esc = exit fullscreen and return to this page.
Look closely over the whole screen in each color: dead pixels (always black), bright pixels (always bright/white), dark pixels (off-color) — any defect will show up in one of the colors.
With several monitors, test one at a time; once you have checked them all and found no defects, press “Confirm no defects, pass”.</system:String>
