    <system:String x:Key="Visual.Intro">Visual check: case, hinges, keys, ports, battery, signs of opening — things software can't measure. Only tick what you have seen with your own eyes. Ticking nothing and passing means the appearance has no faults. Ticking a fault and passing still records it in the conclusion (as a warning), except a swollen battery, which blocks passing because it is dangerous.</system:String>
